<title>USA: USDA ups Tunisia GSM-102 by $10 mln for veg oil.</title>
<headline>USDA ups Tunisia GSM-102 by $10 mln for veg oil.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Monday announced it raised by $10 million the GSM-102 credit guarantee allocations to Tunisia for fiscal year 1997 for vegetable oils.</p>
<p>USDA said the total allocated now stands at $30 million.</p>
<p>Separately, the department also said it authorized $40 million in credit guarantees to Tunisia under the longer term GSM-103 program for fiscal year 1997. USDA said the commodities covered include feed grains and wheat.</p>
</text>
